# Build context for docker/Dockerfile.manuscript needs only uvr.toml/uvr.lock/
# .r-version at build time (the three companion packages install from local
# source at container *run* time, via a bind mount, not baked into the image --
# see ENV-15) -- exclude everything else so the build context stays small and
# builds aren't invalidated by unrelated file changes.
.git/
_targets/
docs/
output/
manuscript/auto/
.uvr/
*.Rproj.user/
cards/
provenance/
